  "result": "Subcommands now pick up their defaults from `default_map`. The fix is one line in `Context.__init__` in `src/click/core.py`.\n\nA child context was inheriting its parent's whole `default_map`. So a map like `{\"runserver\": {\"port\": 5000}}` was searched for `port` directly instead of under `runserver`, and the lookup missed. The child context now takes `parent.default_map.get(info_name)`, which is the subcommand's own section.\n\nThe existing test suite passes (1906 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed). I didn't add a regression test for this case.",
